{"id":"n3-098","title":"まったく～ない (mattaku ~nai)","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Completely not; not at all.","longExplanation":"The まったく～ない grammar point is used to express that something is not the case at all, or to emphasize the negativity of a situation or action. It is used with negative forms of verbs, い-adjectives, and な-adjectives. It can be translated as 'completely not' or 'not at all' in English.","formation":"まったく + Verb-negative, まったく + い-Adjective-negative, まったく + な-Adjective-negative","examples":[{"jp":"彼は、まったく覚えていない。","romaji":"Kare wa, mattaku oboete inai.","en":"He doesn't remember at all.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まったく","vocabId":"1394800","reading":"まったく"},{"surface":"覚え","vocabId":"1206040","reading":"おぼえ","baseForm":"覚える"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"この部屋はまったく暖かくない。","romaji":"Kono heya wa mattaku atatakakunai.","en":"This room is not warm at all.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"部屋","vocabId":"1499320","reading":"へや"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まったく","vocabId":"1394800","reading":"まったく"},{"surface":"暖かく","vocabId":"1586420","reading":"あたたかい","baseForm":"暖かい"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"彼女はまったく遅れていない。","romaji":"Kanojo wa mattaku okurete inai.","en":"She is not late at all.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まったく","vocabId":"1394800","reading":"まったく"},{"surface":"遅れ","vocabId":"1422020","reading":"おくれ","baseForm":"遅れる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]},{"jp":"これはまったく便利ではない。","romaji":"Kore wa mattaku benri de wa nai.","en":"This is not convenient at all.","words":[{"surface":"これ","vocabId":"1628530","reading":"これ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まったく","vocabId":"1394800","reading":"まったく"},{"surface":"便利","vocabId":"1512610","reading":"べんり"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]}]}